{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BackStreet is a 3D action rogue-lite game that combines fast and stylish combo action with strategic growth. The current version is BackStreet's playable-demo version, where you can feel the speedy action. With the Demo version, you can reach up to one in four &quot;back alleys&quot; in total, and see the full journey to liberating the city from the full version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[About this Demo]</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo restricts the following features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Only 1 out of 8 chapters is available </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Only 1 weapon, the blade, is available </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Save feature is not available </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The estimated play time is around 15 minutes based on clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/fight_en.gif?t=1744791768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/steamFight800.gif?t=1744791768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive in a city devastated by environmental pollution using a combination of normal, dash, and jump attacks to adapt to enemy patterns and engage in dynamic combat. Battle against the corrupted machines of 3COS, acquire new skills, and develop your own unique fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/grow_en.gif?t=1744791768\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/steamGrow800.gif?t=1744791768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating enemies grants you boosterchips, a core mechanic for customizing your combat style. By analyzing data obtained from the wreckage of robots, you can inflict various deadly debuffs on your opponents. Optimize your combination of attacks and debuffs to enhance your abilities and uncover the truth behind your lost identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/story_en.gif?t=1744791768\" /><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/glitchStory.gif?t=1744791768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Earth rendered uninhabitable for humans, only the dispatched robots remain, striving to restore what was lost. Defeat 3COS, the AI ruler of the city, and uncover the real story of both humanity and yourself.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3418450?t=1744791768","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744791768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/afb4d6da9e2faebda378e4211596fb40db944887/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744791768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/afb4d6da9e2faebda378e4211596fb40db944887/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744791768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BackStreet is a 3D action rogue-lite game that combines fast and stylish combo action with strategic growth. The current version is BackStreet's playable-demo version, where you can feel the speedy action. With the Demo version, you can reach up to one in four &quot;back alleys&quot; in total, and see the full journey to liberating the city from the full version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[About this Demo]</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo restricts the following features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Only 1 out of 8 chapters is available </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Only 1 weapon, the blade, is available </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Save feature is not available </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The estimated play time is around 15 minutes based on clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/fight_en.gif?t=1744791768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/steamFight800.gif?t=1744791768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive in a city devastated by environmental pollution using a combination of normal, dash, and jump attacks to adapt to enemy patterns and engage in dynamic combat. Battle against the corrupted machines of 3COS, acquire new skills, and develop your own unique fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/grow_en.gif?t=1744791768\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/steamGrow800.gif?t=1744791768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating enemies grants you boosterchips, a core mechanic for customizing your combat style. By analyzing data obtained from the wreckage of robots, you can inflict various deadly debuffs on your opponents. Optimize your combination of attacks and debuffs to enhance your abilities and uncover the truth behind your lost identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/story_en.gif?t=1744791768\" /><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/extras/glitchStory.gif?t=1744791768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Earth rendered uninhabitable for humans, only the dispatched robots remain, striving to restore what was lost. Defeat 3COS, the AI ruler of the city, and uncover the real story of both humanity and yourself.</p>","developers":["Team_BackStreet"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3121410","name":"BackStreet"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418450/header.jpg?t=1744791768","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100692,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100692/movie480.mp4?t=1741052701","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100692/movie_max.mp4?t=1741052701"},"name":"Demo_Action_Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100692/8c0d887c88ad33cd9f170